    "intro_narrative": "Detective, you've finally breached the hidden command center of the infamous criminal syndicate known as 'The Architects'. The dimly lit room is filled with humming server racks, scattered case files, and hastily abandoned equipment from their recent string of heists. A flashing red light on the main screen indicates a critical problem: their entire network is programmed to self-destruct in exactly one hour, a failsafe that threatens to erase all crucial evidence forever. Your ultimate objective is to access the final decryption mainframe and safely download the syndicate's master ledger before the countdown reaches zero. To do this, you must carefully examine the digital breadcrumbs they left behind. Analyze the tools scattered across the desks, operate their locked terminals, and piece together the correct sequence of evidence to break through their intricate security layers. The clock is ticking, and the city is counting on your sharp investigative skills to uncover the truth and bring them to justice.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
  },
